    dc:description "A Major Supernatural Virtue and Ability (the defining power of the Lineage of Pralix) that lets a character see, analyze, and understand active magics without penalizing Magic Resistance." ;
    rpg:hasTag amol:Virtue .
amol:ConfidencePoint a rpg:Tag ;
    skos:prefLabel "Confidence Point" ;
    dc:description "A point a character can spend (for example) to walk away from a situation that would otherwise increase a Verditius magus's Hubris score." ;
