    skos:prefLabel "Ramadan" ;
    dc:description "Islamic month of fasting during which Infernal auras are reduced by two after the Night of Destiny." ;
    skos:altLabel "'Id al-Fitr", "al-'Id al-Saghir" ;
    rpg:hasTag amol:HermeticConcept .
amol:Raphael a rpg:Character ;
    rpg:name "Raphael" ;
    dc:description "Best loved of angels ('God has healed'), Regent of the Sun, head of the guardian angels and of the Cherubim Choir, who protects humanity and heals the sick." ;
    rpg:inWorld amol:MythicEurope ;
    rpg:hasTag amol:CharacterTag .
amol:Ravenna a schema:Place ;
    rpg:name "Ravenna" ;
    dc:description "Canal city praised for the purity of its air." ;
    rpg:inWorld amol:MythicEurope ;
    rpg:hasTag amol:Place .
amol:RealmAlignedSpells a rpg:Tag ;
    skos:prefLabel "Realm-Aligned Spells" ;
    dc:description "Spells invented, as a Minor Breakthrough, to be 'flavored' to the Magic, Faerie or Infernal realm so they are unaffected by and botch less in that realm's aura." ;
    skos:altLabel "realm-aligned spell" ;
    rpg:hasTag amol:HermeticConcept .
amol:RedKnight a rpg:Creature ;
    rpg:name "Red Knight" ;
    dc:description "Bringer of Requested Inundations: a demon (Lord of the Avengers of Evil, Infernal Might 30) who drowns victims and destroyed Ys and Lyonesse, but may only harm people after a treacherous mortal grants permission." ;
    skos:altLabel "Bringer of Requested Inundations", "Red Knight of Ys", "The Red Knight of Ys" ;
