amol:Metathiax a rpg:Creature ;
    rpg:name "Metathiax" ;
    dc:description "A decanus, Master of the Avengers of Evil, who inflicts diseases of the kidneys and rules the first third of Cancer's reign; he is thwarted by the angel Adonael." ;
